msgid ""
"Enter Recovery Stance by holding down <Action:Battle_Heavy_Attack@Combat> "
"when using certain attacks, such as the fourth hit in an unarmed combo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3580"
msgid ""
"This will let you build up Heat, but leave you unable to move and "
"vulnerable to enemy attacks. Recovery Stance can be used with many "
"different moves and skills⑬give it a try!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3592"
msgid ""
"If you learn when and where to enter Recovery Stance, you can earn extra "
"Heat, making it easier to execute critical blows. Continue to practice, and "
"you will master it before long."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3604"
msgid "Come back to see me whenever you like, my prized pupil."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3616"
msgid ""
"Well, if it isn't my dearest disciple! Would you like to face my top pupil "
"again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3652"
msgid "I cannot teach you new techniques when someone is fighting alongside you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3664"
msgid "These techniques cannot be allowed into the hands of outsiders!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3736"
msgid ""
"I don't think it'll end any different, no matter how many times we spar, "
"but I never back down from a challenge!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3748"
msgid "Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3760"
msgid "Now... begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3784"
msgid "No? Well, let me know if you change your mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3796"
msgid "You win!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3808"
msgid ""
"You did well. If I hadn't been paying attention, you might've laid me out "
"on the floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3820"
msgid ""
"Here I was thinking I was the best of Master Komaki's students... I'll "
"train hard, so the next time we face each other, I'll come out on top!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3832"
msgid ""
"I'd be happy to fight you again, give you another chance to test your "
"skills."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3844"
msgid ""
"You can now use <Color:9>Komaki Daruma Tumbler<Color:Default>. Press "
"<Action:Battle_Dodge@Combat> again while quickstepping to enhance your "
"quickstep even further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3904"
msgid ""
"Well done! I do believe your Komaki techniques have once again been honed "
"to perfection!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3916"
msgid ""
"Practicing all these old techniques makes me want to train with you again. "
"Maybe you can teach me some new moves next time, old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3928"
msgid ""
"Oho? Well, feel free to come back whenever you like! I very much enjoy "
"watching you grow stronger, my dearest disciple."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3940"
msgid "Well, I'm glad I can at least provide you with some entertainment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3952"
msgid "And if it keeps you from going senile, then it's well worth the pain."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3964"
msgid "Hey, now! I'm still young, you know! Show your master some respect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3976"
msgid "Heh, sorry to ruffle your feathers, old man. I'll see you later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3988"
msgid "Hahaha! Looks like you need more practice, Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4000"
msgid "(I lost... I'd better try again sometime.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4036"
msgid "Well, if it isn't my favorite pupil!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4048"
msgid "I've defeated all of your former pupils."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4060"
msgid "So I hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4072"
msgid ""
"However, I cannot teach you new techniques when someone is fighting "
"alongside you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4084"
msgid "These techniques cannot be allowed into the hands of outsiders!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4096"
msgid "Come back when you're alone. I'll be waiting!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4108"
msgid ""
"Oho, if it isn't my dearest disciple! I heard you defeated all three of my "
"former pupils!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4120"
msgid ""
"I knew you could do it. Seems your skills are not as rusty as I once "
"thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4132"
msgid "I suppose. They all put up a pretty good fight, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4144"
msgid ""
"It definitely helped me remember all the techniques you taught me in the "
"past."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4156"
msgid ""
"Excellent. Once you learn a technique, it stays with you, even when you "
"think you have completely forgotten it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4168"
msgid "Yeah. Looks like I've got it all back now. Thanks for the help, old man."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4180"
msgid ""
"Now that I've got the old techniques back, can I start learning some new "
"ones?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4192"
msgid ""
"Not so fast. The people you defeated are skilled fighters indeed, but they "
"are former pupils, not current ones."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4204"
msgid "I believe you still have more to remember, yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4216"
msgid ""
"Yeah, you might be right... Those former pupils of yours were tough, but if "
"I could spar against someone tougher, I might remember even more old "
"techniques."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4228"
msgid "Very well, then. Would you like to try facing an active Komaki master?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4240"
msgid "You mean you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4252"
msgid ""
"No, no. You will be facing my top pupil. I can vouch for his strength. You "
"may not be able to beat him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4264"
msgid ""
"Really? Well, it's not like I'm completely out of practice. We'll see how "
"tough this guy is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4288"
msgid "All right, let's do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4300"
msgid ""
"Guess I'm the \"final boss\" for you, huh, Kiryu-san? I do train for hours "
"every single day. I think you'll find me a difficult opponent to beat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4360"
msgid "Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4372"
msgid "Now... begin!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4396"
msgid ""
"You haven't defeated all three of my former pupils yet. Would you like me "
"to tell you about them again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4408"
msgid "I'll tell you where to find them, so listen carefully."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4420"
msgid ""
"The first pupil of mine works at a sushi restaurant. He quit his training "
"to pursue his dream of being a sushi chef."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4432"
msgid ""
"The second one also works at some kind of restaurant. I don't remember the "
"name, but it had something to do with smiling..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4444"
msgid ""
"The third one works as a barker on Shichifuku Street. I believe he works "
"for some sort of club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4480"
msgid "Remember, you can only fight them when you are alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4492"
msgid ""
"You will learn nothing if others aid you in battle. My pupils will not "
"agree to take you on if they see you've brought someone with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4504"
msgid "Would you like to hear my explanation once more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4516"
msgid "Very well. Come to see me once you've located and defeated all of my pupils."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4528"
msgid ""
"Well, if it isn't my favorite pupil! It has been far too long since our "
"last meeting. I'm pleased you have come to see me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4540"
msgid "It's good to see you, too. Doing well, I assume?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4552"
msgid ""
"Of course! I have more pupils than I know what to do with, ever since I "
"opened this dojo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4564"
msgid "It's been quite a while since you left Kamurocho, Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4576"
msgid ""
"Have you retained the skills I taught you, or have they grown rusty in the "
"time that has passed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4588"
msgid ""
"Well, I haven't been fighting for my life as much, ever since I moved to "
"Okinawa. I suppose I haven't really had many chances to use your moves in "
"combat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4600"
msgid "To be honest, I'm not even sure if I remember them all anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4612"
msgid ""
"Still, I might need to use your techniques to protect the ones I love. "
"Would you mind teaching them to me again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4624"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4636"
msgid "Very well. Let us revisit your training once more."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4648"
msgid ""
"First, we must review what you've already learned. I can't teach you new "
"techniques if you cannot remember the simplest basics. Let's see what you "
"still remember."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4660"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4672"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4684"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4696"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4708"
msgid ""
"Oho! I've got it! Three of my former pupils work here in Kamurocho. Find "
"them and challenge them to a fight!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4720"
msgid ""
"Wait, what? I thought you were going to teach me again, not some of your "
"pupils."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4732"
msgid ""
"Everything must be done in the proper order. Defeating fighters who are "
"skilled in my techniques should help you remember the moves you have "
"forgotten."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4744"
msgid ""
"These pupils of mine are some of the finest fighters I've ever taught. You "
"won't have an easy time of it, believe me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4756"
msgid "I believe you. I'm more than a little rusty."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4768"
msgid "All right. Where can I find these pupils of yours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4780"
msgid "I will tell you where you can find them. Listen carefully, now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4792"
msgid ""
"The first pupil of mine works at a sushi restaurant. He quit his training "
"to pursue his dream of being a sushi chef."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4804"
msgid ""
"The second one also works at some kind of restaurant. I don't remember the "
"name, but it had something to do with smiling..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4816"
msgid ""
"The third one works as a barker on Shichifuku Street. I believe he works "
"for some sort of club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4852"
msgid "Now, you can only fight them when you are alone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4864"
msgid ""
"You will learn nothing if others aid you in battle. My pupils will not "
"agree to take you on if they see you've brought someone with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4876"
msgid "Would you like to hear my explanation once more?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4888"
msgid "Very well. Come to see me once you've located and defeated all of my pupils."
msgstr ""

